# Eval of an RPM checkpoint trained with train_amass_p2_{reactive,smooth}.args
# under VR_Pose_Pred's AMASS protocol: every real frame scored (skip 0) after a
# static left pad that covers the rollout's whole GT seed (auto: 10 context
# frames + the first W-frame anchor), so the only GT the model sees is the held
# first-frame pose; the P2 tree is 60 fps (RPM's own P2: 30). Report mpjre_body
# (21 body joints = VR_Pose_Pred's mpjre), mpjpe, mpjve, pred_jitter / 100 and
# handpe; gt_jitter must read 292.48.
#   python test.py --model_path ./results/amass_p2_ours/checkpoints/<reactive|smooth>/model_latest.pt @configs/amass_ours/eval_amass_p2.args
--eval
--eval_batch_size 16
--dataset amass_p2
--data_source vr_pose_pred
--dataset_path ./datasets_processed_ours/
--results_dir ./results/amass_p2_ours
--eval_left_pad -1
--eval_skip_frames 0
--eval_fps 60
